entries[247675] = { ["name"] = "Aura of Reckoning", ["text"] = "40 yd range\nHoly\nWhen you or allies within your Aura are critically struck, gain Reckoning. Gain 1 additional stack if you are the victim.\n\nAt 100 stacks of Reckoning, your next Judgment deals 25% increased damage, will critically strike, and activates Avenging Wrath for 6 sec.\n\nRetribution\nWhen you or allies within your Aura are critically struck, gain Reckoning. Gain 1 additional stack if you are the victim.\n\nAt 100 stacks of Reckoning, your next weapon swing deals 200% increased damage, will critically strike, and activates Avenging Wrath for 6 sec.\n\nProtection\nWhen you or allies within your Aura are critically struck, gain Reckoning. Gain 1 additional stack if you are the victim.\n\nAt 100 stacks of Reckoning, your next weapon swing deals 200% increased damage, will critically strike, and activates Avenging Wrath for 6 sec." }
